","zh":"我非常钦佩她的勇气和善良。"},{"en":"Reading widely can broaden your vision.","zh":"广泛阅读可以开阔你的眼界。"},{"en":"The success came through years of hard work.","zh":"成功来自于多年的努力。"},{"en":"He has a strong sense of responsibility.","zh":"他有强烈的责任感。"},{"en":"The environment is fundamental to our life.","zh":"环境对我们的生命至关重要。"},{"en":"We should protect endangered species.","zh":"我们应该保护濒危物种。"},{"en":"She devoted herself entirely to education.","zh":"她全身心投入教育。"},{"en":"The invention changed our way of life forever.","zh":"这项发明永远改变了我们的生活方式。"},{"en":"Many ancient traditions are still preserved today.","zh":"许多古代传统至今仍被保留。"},{"en":"Economic growth has brought great benefits to the city.","zh":"经济增长给这座城市带来了巨大利益。"},{"en":"We must find an effective solution to the problem.","zh":"我们必须找到解决这个问题的有效方法。"},{"en":"The scientist discovered a new species of plant.","zh":"科学家发现了一种新的植物物种。"},{"en":"Global warming is a serious challenge for all of us.","zh":"全球变暖对我们所有人都是一个严峻的挑战。"},{"en":"He has a great influence on the young generation.","zh":"他对年轻一代有很大的影响。"},{"en":"The research proved that exercise improves memory.","zh":"研究证明锻炼能改善记忆力。"},{"en":"We should take responsibility for our own actions.","zh":"我们应该为自己的行为负责。"},{"en":"The government announced a new policy on education.","zh":"政府宣布了一项新的教育政策。"},{"en":"Her performance was extraordinary and moved everyone.","zh":"她的表演非常出色，感动了所有人。"},{"en":"He concentrated on his studies and made great progress.","zh":"他专心学习，取得了很大进步。"},{"en":"The experiment confirmed our hypothesis.","zh":"实验证实了我们的假设。"},{"en":"Cooperation between countries is essential for peace.","zh":"国家间的合作对和平至关重要。"},{"en":"We should respect cultural diversity.","zh":"我们应该尊重文化多样性。"},{"en":"The library provides a convenient place for study.","zh":"图书馆为学习提供了便利的场所。"},{"en":"He was determined to overcome all the difficulties.","zh":"他决心克服一切困难。"},{"en":"Education plays a vital role in a nation's development.","zh":"教育在一个国家的发展中起着至关重要的作用。"},{"en":"The rapid development of technology has changed our lives.","zh":"技术的快速发展改变了我们的生活。"},{"en":"She expressed her gratitude to all the supporters.","zh":"她向所有支持者表达了感激之情。"},{"en":"We should balance work and rest for better health.","zh":"为了更好的健康，我们应该平衡工作和休息。"},{"en":"The company made a huge profit last year.","zh":"这家公司去年获得了巨大利润。"},{"en":"He has a positive attitude towards life.","zh":"他对生活持积极态度。"},{"en":"The museum houses many valuable works of art.","zh":"这家博物馆收藏了许多有价值的艺术品。"},{"en":"Scientists are exploring new ways to save energy.","zh":"科学家们正在探索节约能源的新方法。"},{"en":"The bridge is a symbol of friendship between the two cities.","zh":"这座桥是两个城市友谊的象征。"},{"en":"We must preserve our cultural heritage for future generations.","zh":"我们必须为子孙后代保护我们的文化遗产。"},{"en":"Her dedication to teaching inspired many students.","zh":"她对教学的奉献激励了许多学生。"},{"en":"The city has a population of several million.","zh":"这座城市有数百万人口。"},{"en":"He made a remarkable contribution to medical science.","zh":"他对医学科学做出了卓越的贡献。"},{"en":"The atmosphere in the classroom was full of enthusiasm.","zh":"教室里的气氛充满了热情。"},{"en":"We should take every opportunity to improve ourselves.","zh":"我们应该抓住每一个提高自己的机会。"},{"en":"The novel reflects the social reality of that time.","zh":"这部小说反映了那个时代的社会现实。"},{"en":"He responded to the question in a calm voice.","zh":"他用平静的声音回答了这个问题。"},{"en":"Perseverance is the key to achieving success.","zh":"毅力是取得成功的关键。"},{"en":"The teacher encouraged us to think independently.","zh":"老师鼓励我们独立思考。"},{"en":"Modern science has brought us many wonders.","zh":"现代科学给我们带来了许多奇迹。"},{"en":"She has a strong desire to become a scientist.","zh":"她有成为科学家的强烈愿望。"},{"en":"The landscape of the countryside is truly beautiful.","zh":"乡村的风景真的很美。"},{"en":"We should be aware of the importance of protecting nature.","zh":"我们应该意识到保护自然的重要性。"},{"en":"His knowledge of history is extensive.","zh":"他的历史知识很渊博。"},{"en":"The company is famous for its high quality products.","zh":"这家公司以其高质量的产品而闻名。"},{"en":"Reading is an effective way to broaden your horizons.","zh":"阅读是开阔视野的有效方式。"},{"en":"She took part in the competition and won first prize.","zh":"她参加了比赛并获得了一等奖。"},{"en":"We should develop a good habit of learning English.","zh":"我们应该养成学习英语的好习惯。"},{"en":"The teacher explained the grammar point clearly.","zh":"老师清楚地讲解了语法点。"},{"en":"His courage in the face of danger impressed everyone.","zh":"他在危险面前的勇气给每个人留下了深刻印象。"},{"en":"The team worked together to solve the problem.","zh":"团队一起努力解决了这个问题。"},{"en":"Nature provides us with everything we need.","zh":"大自然为我们提供所需的一切。"},{"en":"We should try our best to help those in need.","zh":"我们应该尽力帮助那些需要帮助的人。"},{"en":"The weather forecast says it will be sunny tomorrow.","zh":"天气预报说明天将是晴天。"},{"en":"She showed great patience in teaching the children.","zh":"她在教孩子们时表现出极大的耐心。"},{"en":"He is respected by everyone for his honesty.","zh":"他因诚实而受到每个人的尊敬。"},{"en":"The book contains a lot of useful information.","zh":"这本书包含许多有用的信息。"}],"grammar":[{"category":"冠词","question":"He is ___ honest man.","options":["a","an","the","/"],"answer":1,"explain":"honest 以元音音素开头，用 an。","question_zh":"他是一个诚实的人。"},{"category":"介词","question":"The success came ___ hard work.","options":["from","through","by","with"],"answer":1,"explain":"through 表示通过某种过程达成。","question_zh":"成功来自于努力工作。"},{"category":"时态-过去完成","question":"By the time we arrived, the film ___ already.","options":["started","has started","had started","was starting"],"answer":2,"explain":"到达是过去，电影发生在那之前，用过去完成时。","question_zh":"当我们到达时，电影已经开始了。"},{"category":"时态-现在进行","question":"I ___ a letter now, so I can't go out.","options":["write","wrote","am writing","have written"],"answer":2,"explain":"now 表此刻正在进行，用现在进行时。","question_zh":"我现在正在写信，所以不能出去。"},{"category":"时态-一般过去","question":"They ___ in London for five years before they moved.","options":["live","lived","have lived","are living"],"answer":1,"explain":"moved 之前的一段过去经历用一般过去时。","question_zh":"他们搬走之前在伦敦住了五年。"},{"category":"时态-现在完成","question":"He ___ in this company since 2010.","options":["works","worked","has worked","is working"],"answer":2,"explain":"since + 过去时间点，主句用现在完成时。","question_zh":"他自2010年以来就在这家公司工作。"},{"category":"时态-将来","question":"The train ___ at eight tomorrow morning.","options":["leaves","left","is leaving","will have left"],"answer":0,"explain":"时刻表用一般现在时表将来。","question_zh":"火车明早八点出发。"},{"category":"时态-过去进行","question":"When the phone rang, I ___ TV.","options":["watched","was watching","have watched","watch"],"answer":1,"explain":"过去某时刻正在发生的动作用过去进行时。","question_zh":"电话响时，我正在看电视。"},{"category":"被动语态","question":"The problem ___ at the meeting yesterday.","options":["discussed","was discussed","has discussed","is discussing"],"answer":1,"explain":"过去时被动语态：was + 过去分词。","question_zh":"这个问题昨天在会议上被讨论。"},{"category":"被动语态","question":"English ___ in many countries.","options":["speaks","is spoken","has spoken","is speaking"],"answer":1,"explain":"一般现在时被动：be + 过去分词。","question_zh":"许多国家都讲英语。"},{"category":"虚拟语气","question":"If I ___ you, I would take the job.","options":["am","was","were","be"],"answer":2,"explain":"与现在事实相反的虚拟语气，if 从句用 were。","question_zh":"如果我是你，我会接受这份工作。"},{"category":"虚拟语气","question":"I wish I ___ fly like a bird.","options":["can","could","will","would"],"answer":1,"explain":"wish 后的虚拟语气表示愿望，用 could。","question_zh":"我希望我能像鸟一样飞。"},{"category":"定语从句","question":"The man ___ helped me is my neighbor.","options":["which","who","whom","whose"],"answer":1,"explain":"先行词是人，从句中作主语用 who。","question_zh":"帮助我的那个人是我的邻居。"},{"category":"定语从句","question":"This is the book ___ I bought yesterday.","options":["who","which","where","when"],"answer":1,"explain":"先行词是物，从句中作宾语用 which。","question_zh":"这是我昨天买的那本书。"},{"category":"定语从句","question":"I still remember the day ___ we met.","options":["which","that","when","where"],"answer":2,"explain":"先行词是时间，用关系副词 when。","question_zh":"我仍然记得我们相遇的那一天。"},{"category":"名词性从句","question":"___ he will come is still unknown.","options":["That","Whether","If","What"],"answer":1,"explain":"主语从句表示“是否”用 Whether。","question_zh":"他是否会来仍不得而知。"},{"category":"名词性从句","question":"That is ___ I want to tell you.","options":["what","which","that","when"],"answer":0,"explain":"表语从句，缺宾语用 what。","question_zh":"那就是我想告诉你的。"},{"category":"状语从句","question":"___ it was raining, we still went out.","options":["Because","Although","Since","As"],"answer":1,"explain":"although 表示转折“虽然”。","question_zh":"虽然下着雨，我们还是出去了。"},{"category":"状语从句","question":"I'll wait here ___ you come back.","options":["until","because","although","so"],"answer":0,"explain":"until 表示“直到……”。","question_zh":"我会在这里等到你回来。"},{"category":"非谓语-不定式","question":"He decided ___ abroad for further study.","options":["go","to go","going","gone"],"answer":1,"explain":"decide to do sth. 决定做某事。","question_zh":"他决定出国深造。"},{"category":"非谓语-动名词","question":"___ is more important than learning.","options":["Think","Thinking","To thinking","Thought"],"answer":1,"explain":"动名词作主语表一般行为。","question_zh":"思考比学习更重要。"},{"category":"非谓语-现在分词","question":"___ from the hill, the city looks beautiful.","options":["See","Seeing","Seen","To see"],"answer":2,"explain":"逻辑主语 the city 与 see 是被动关系，用过去分词 Seen。","question_zh":"从山上望去，这座城市很美。"},{"category":"情态动词","question":"You ___ have told me earlier.","options":["should","need","dare","must"],"answer":0,"explain":"should have done 表示本应做而未做。","question_zh":"你本该早点告诉我。"},{"category":"情态动词","question":"He ___ be at home because the light is on.","options":["must","can't","needn't","shouldn't"],"answer":0,"explain":"灯亮着，推测一定在家用 must。","question_zh":"他一定在家，因为灯亮着。"},{"category":"情态动词","question":"You ___ finish the work today. Tomorrow is fine.","options":["mustn't","needn't","can't","shouldn't"],"answer":1,"explain":"needn't 表示不必。","question_zh":"你不必今天完成工作，明天也行。"},{"category":"倒装","question":"Never ___ I seen such a beautiful place.","options":["have","had","will","do"],"answer":0,"explain":"否定词 never 置于句首，主句部分倒装。","question_zh":"我从未见过如此美丽的地方。"},{"category":"主谓一致","question":"The number of students ___ increasing.","options":["is","are","were","have"],"answer":0,"explain":"the number of 作主语，谓语用单数。","question_zh":"学生人数在增加。"},{"category":"主谓一致","question":"Each of the boys ___ a book.","options":["have","has","are having","were"],"answer":1,"explain":"each of + 复数，谓语用单数。","question_zh":"每个男孩都有一本书。"},{"category":"强调句","question":"It was in the park ___ I met him.","options":["that","where","which","when"],"answer":0,"explain":"强调句型 It is/was + 被强调部分 + that。","question_zh":"正是在公园里我遇到了他。"},{"category":"比较结构","question":"The more you practice, ___ you will be.","options":["the better","better","the best","the good"],"answer":0,"explain":"the + 比较级，the + 比较级，表示“越……越……”。","question_zh":"你练习得越多，就会越好。"},{"category":"独立主格","question":"The weather ___ fine, we went hiking.","options":["was","being","been","to be"],"answer":1,"explain":"独立主格结构，逻辑主语与 being 搭配。","question_zh":"天气很好，我们去远足了。"},{"category":"让步状语","question":"___ he is young, he knows a lot.","options":["Though","Because","Since","So"],"answer":0,"explain":"though 引导让步状语从句表“虽然”。","question_zh":"虽然他很年轻，但他知道很多。"}]}
